# Code owners for this repository.
#
# Entries are matched last-to-first: the last matching pattern wins.
# Owning every path means a review request goes to the owners on every pull
# request, and — once branch protection enables "Require review from Code
# Owners" — no pull request merges without that review.
#
# An owner must have write access to this repository, or the entry is ignored.
#
# There is more than one owner because an author is never asked to review their
# own pull request. A single owner who is also the usual author therefore leaves
# every one of their pull requests with no reviewer requested at all, while
# branch protection still requires an approving review.

# Repository-wide owners.
